{
  "episode": "ep03",
  "title": "平安貴族はすごい!〜摂関政治と国風文化〜",
  "gaps": {
    "beat": 0.3,
    "scene": 0.6,
    "section": 0.8,
    "tail": 0.6
  },
  "total_duration": 561.931,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "s01",
      "section": "opening",
      "start": 0.0,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b00.wav",
          "start": 0.0,
          "duration": 4.181,
          "text": "ねえ先生、どうして天皇なのに政治ができない時期があったの？"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b01.wav",
          "start": 4.481,
          "duration": 6.272,
          "text": "実は、藤原氏の工夫と、貴族の文化がかぎなんです!平安のしくみを、順番に見ていきましょう。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s01_b02.wav",
          "start": 11.053,
          "duration": 2.485,
          "text": "よし、平安からスタートなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 14.339,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b00.wav",
          "start": 14.339,
          "duration": 2.368,
          "text": "まずは、なにから始まったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b01.wav",
          "start": 17.007,
          "duration": 4.512,
          "text": "8世紀の終わり、桓武天皇は政治を立て直すため、都を移します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b02.wav",
          "start": 21.819,
          "duration": 5.579,
          "text": "いったん長岡京へ、そして794年に平安京へ遷都しました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b03.wav",
          "start": 27.697,
          "duration": 2.592,
          "text": "平安京…今の京都なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b04.wav",
          "start": 30.589,
          "duration": 3.957,
          "text": "ええ、ここから1000年以上、京都は日本の中心になります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b05.wav",
          "start": 34.847,
          "duration": 3.957,
          "text": "「平安」の名には、穏やかな世の中への願いが込められています。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b06.wav",
          "start": 39.104,
          "duration": 2.592,
          "text": "穏やかな世の中…いい名前なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s02_b07.wav",
          "start": 41.996,
          "duration": 3.701,
          "text": "ただ、都の外では、東北で蝦夷との戦いが続いていました。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 46.297,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b00.wav",
          "start": 46.297,
          "duration": 2.571,
          "text": "東北の戦いって、なんなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b01.wav",
          "start": 49.168,
          "duration": 5.173,
          "text": "東北には、大和の国の支配を受けない蝦夷のひとたちがいました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b02.wav",
          "start": 54.641,
          "duration": 4.224,
          "text": "朝廷は征夷大将軍を立てて、討伐に向かいます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b03.wav",
          "start": 59.165,
          "duration": 4.139,
          "text": "797年、坂上田村麻呂が征夷大将軍となり、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b04.wav",
          "start": 63.604,
          "duration": 3.264,
          "text": "胆沢城を築くなど、東北の平定に成功します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b05.wav",
          "start": 67.168,
          "duration": 2.517,
          "text": "強い将軍なのだ!かっこいいのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b06.wav",
          "start": 69.985,
          "duration": 0.779,
          "text": "そうなんです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b07.wav",
          "start": 71.064,
          "duration": 2.368,
          "text": "征夷大将軍という名は、後の時代、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b08.wav",
          "start": 73.732,
          "duration": 2.432,
          "text": "武士のリーダーの役職として復活しますよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s03_b09.wav",
          "start": 76.464,
          "duration": 1.739,
          "text": "後の武士につながるのだ!?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 78.803,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b00.wav",
          "start": 78.803,
          "duration": 2.315,
          "text": "平安京は、平和なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b01.wav",
          "start": 81.417,
          "duration": 3.008,
          "text": "実は、皇室の中でも権力争いがありました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b02.wav",
          "start": 84.725,
          "duration": 4.192,
          "text": "嵯峨天皇のとき、平城上皇側の藤原薬子が政治を元に戻そうとして、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b03.wav",
          "start": 89.217,
          "duration": 0.992,
          "text": "退けられます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b04.wav",
          "start": 90.509,
          "duration": 2.016,
          "text": "それが、あの薬子なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b05.wav",
          "start": 92.825,
          "duration": 2.485,
          "text": "そう、810年の薬子の変です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b06.wav",
          "start": 95.611,
          "duration": 2.923,
          "text": "これをきっかけに、嵯峨天皇は天皇のそば仕えの役所、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b07.wav",
          "start": 98.833,
          "duration": 1.728,
          "text": "蔵人所を新設しました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b08.wav",
          "start": 100.861,
          "duration": 2.603,
          "text": "蔵人所?かわいい名前なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s04_b09.wav",
          "start": 103.764,
          "duration": 4.245,
          "text": "天皇のまちかどで機密を扱い、後に大きな力を持つようになりますよ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 108.609,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b00.wav",
          "start": 108.609,
          "duration": 2.56,
          "text": "つぎに強くなったのは、だれなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b01.wav",
          "start": 111.469,
          "duration": 5.067,
          "text": "藤原氏です。やり方は、自分の娘を天皇の后に入れること。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b02.wav",
          "start": 116.836,
          "duration": 3.808,
          "text": "生まれた子は藤原氏の孫になる、というわけです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b03.wav",
          "start": 120.944,
          "duration": 4.277,
          "text": "おかあさんが藤原さんなら、天皇は藤原さんの孫なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b04.wav",
          "start": 125.521,
          "duration": 0.725,
          "text": "そのとおり。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b05.wav",
          "start": 126.547,
          "duration": 0.725,
          "text": "そうして力を固めた藤原良房は、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b06.wav",
          "start": 127.572,
          "duration": 3.744,
          "text": "幼い清和天皇の代わりに政治を行う、摂政に就きます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b07.wav",
          "start": 131.616,
          "duration": 5.003,
          "text": "さらに甥の基経は、大人の天皇を支える関白に。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b08.wav",
          "start": 136.919,
          "duration": 5.653,
          "text": "この二つを藤原氏が独占した政治を、摂関政治と言います。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s05_b09.wav",
          "start": 142.872,
          "duration": 4.544,
          "text": "「代わりに行く」と「そばで支える」なのだ!覚えたのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 148.016,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b00.wav",
          "start": 148.016,
          "duration": 2.976,
          "text": "摂関政治が、いちばん盛り上がったのは?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b01.wav",
          "start": 151.292,
          "duration": 2.24,
          "text": "藤原道長のときです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b02.wav",
          "start": 153.832,
          "duration": 6.816,
          "text": "三人の娘を三人の天皇に入内させ、政治を自由に動かしました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b03.wav",
          "start": 160.948,
          "duration": 3.179,
          "text": "「望むこと、なしとなし」って言ったのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b04.wav",
          "start": 164.427,
          "duration": 3.051,
          "text": "ええ、天下を取った気分の一言と伝わります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b05.wav",
          "start": 167.777,
          "duration": 3.605,
          "text": "でも、天皇や武士の不満も、少しずつ溜まっていきました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b06.wav",
          "start": 171.683,
          "duration": 2.645,
          "text": "キラキラの裏は、ぐっすりの種なのだ…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s06_b07.wav",
          "start": 174.628,
          "duration": 3.349,
          "text": "そのとおり。このひずみが、次の時代の扉を開けます。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 178.577,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b00.wav",
          "start": 178.577,
          "duration": 3.147,
          "text": "中国との交流は、その後どうなったのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b01.wav",
          "start": 182.024,
          "duration": 5.845,
          "text": "894年、菅原道真の建言で遣唐使が停止されます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b02.wav",
          "start": 188.169,
          "duration": 4.832,
          "text": "唐の乱れと、あらゆる物を学び尽くしたことが理由です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b03.wav",
          "start": 193.301,
          "duration": 2.347,
          "text": "学び終わって、おしまいなのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b04.wav",
          "start": 195.948,
          "duration": 5.355,
          "text": "そう、これを機に、日本らしい文化、国風文化が花開きます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b05.wav",
          "start": 201.603,
          "duration": 3.808,
          "text": "文字も絵も物語も、日本色たっぷりにね。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s07_b06.wav",
          "start": 205.711,
          "duration": 2.656,
          "text": "国風文化、この後楽しみなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 208.967,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b00.wav",
          "start": 208.967,
          "duration": 3.093,
          "text": "平安貴族の家って、どんな感じなのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b01.wav",
          "start": 212.36,
          "duration": 1.077,
          "text": "寝殿造です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b02.wav",
          "start": 213.737,
          "duration": 1.077,
          "text": "中央の寝殿を、対屋と回廊で囲み、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b03.wav",
          "start": 215.115,
          "duration": 3.477,
          "text": "南に池と庭を配した、風を通す開放的な家です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b04.wav",
          "start": 218.892,
          "duration": 2.976,
          "text": "寝殿造って、お寺の建物なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b05.wav",
          "start": 222.168,
          "duration": 4.011,
          "text": "いいえ、貴族の住まいです。お寺はもっと厳かな造りなんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b06.wav",
          "start": 226.479,
          "duration": 1.6,
          "text": "池つきで贅沢なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b07.wav",
          "start": 228.379,
          "duration": 2.912,
          "text": "宮中に仕える女房たちは、女房装束、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b08.wav",
          "start": 231.591,
          "duration": 3.168,
          "text": "いわゆる十二単を着て、筆や和歌で社交しました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b09.wav",
          "start": 235.059,
          "duration": 3.659,
          "text": "十二単!12枚着るのだ?重くないのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b10.wav",
          "start": 239.017,
          "duration": 2.731,
          "text": "名前のわりに、その枚数は流動的でした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b11.wav",
          "start": 242.048,
          "duration": 2.731,
          "text": "公式は漢字で、日常の手紙はかなで。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b12.wav",
          "start": 245.079,
          "duration": 2.613,
          "text": "文字の使い分けも、貴族のたしなみなんですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b13.wav",
          "start": 247.992,
          "duration": 4.331,
          "text": "奈良は寺が中心だったけれど、平安は貴族のくらしが文化の主役です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s08_b14.wav",
          "start": 252.623,
          "duration": 2.347,
          "text": "漢字とかな、使いこなしなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 255.569,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b00.wav",
          "start": 255.569,
          "duration": 2.549,
          "text": "ぐっすりの種…土地の話なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b01.wav",
          "start": 258.419,
          "duration": 2.731,
          "text": "なぜなら開墾を進めたかったからです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b02.wav",
          "start": 261.449,
          "duration": 5.771,
          "text": "その結果、743年の墾田永年私財法で私有が認められました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b03.wav",
          "start": 267.52,
          "duration": 2.731,
          "text": "すると力のある貴族や寺社が開墾地を集め、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b04.wav",
          "start": 270.551,
          "duration": 3.115,
          "text": "税を納めない私有地、荘園が広がっていきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b05.wav",
          "start": 273.965,
          "duration": 2.816,
          "text": "国の税金を、すり抜ける土地なのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b06.wav",
          "start": 277.081,
          "duration": 0.725,
          "text": "そのとおり。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b07.wav",
          "start": 278.107,
          "duration": 3.552,
          "text": "班田はどんどんゆがみ、公地公民のルールが崩れていきました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b08.wav",
          "start": 281.959,
          "duration": 3.221,
          "text": "これが後の武士と戦の、長い物語の入り口です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s09_b09.wav",
          "start": 285.48,
          "duration": 3.371,
          "text": "743年、ここから全部が動くのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 289.451,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b00.wav",
          "start": 289.451,
          "duration": 3.531,
          "text": "ついに、国風文化なのだ!文字の話なのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b01.wav",
          "start": 293.281,
          "duration": 4.949,
          "text": "ええ。漢字から生まれた、日本独自のかな文字が広がります。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b02.wav",
          "start": 298.531,
          "duration": 3.861,
          "text": "「古今和歌集」も、かなの和歌集として編さんされました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b03.wav",
          "start": 302.692,
          "duration": 4.107,
          "text": "紀貫之は、かなで書いた日記『土佐日記』。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b04.wav",
          "start": 307.099,
          "duration": 4.235,
          "text": "女性のふりをして書いた、かな日記のはじまりです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b05.wav",
          "start": 311.633,
          "duration": 2.592,
          "text": "男が女性のふり…ずるいのだ!?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b06.wav",
          "start": 314.525,
          "duration": 6.635,
          "text": "さらに清少納言の随筆『枕草子』、紫式部の物語『源氏物語』。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b07.wav",
          "start": 321.46,
          "duration": 4.16,
          "text": "源氏物語は世界最古の長編小説と呼ばれます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b08.wav",
          "start": 325.92,
          "duration": 2.923,
          "text": "マナブ、源氏物語の作者、覚えてる?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b09.wav",
          "start": 329.143,
          "duration": 1.419,
          "text": "紫式部なのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s10_b10.wav",
          "start": 330.861,
          "duration": 3.584,
          "text": "枕草子と源氏物語、セットで覚えるのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 335.045,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b00.wav",
          "start": 335.045,
          "duration": 2.229,
          "text": "絵も、日本風になるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b01.wav",
          "start": 337.575,
          "duration": 3.381,
          "text": "ええ、横長の絵巻物が発達します。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b02.wav",
          "start": 341.256,
          "duration": 4.843,
          "text": "物語を絵と文字で進める、日本発の表現です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b03.wav",
          "start": 346.399,
          "duration": 4.789,
          "text": "源氏物語絵巻や、鳥獣戯画は、今でも人気の名品ですよ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b04.wav",
          "start": 351.488,
          "duration": 3.477,
          "text": "うさぎとカエルが相撲してる絵なのだ!?大好きなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b05.wav",
          "start": 355.265,
          "duration": 4.587,
          "text": "笑えますよね。文学と絵がそろって、国風文化は華やかの頂点でした。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s11_b06.wav",
          "start": 360.152,
          "duration": 3.435,
          "text": "平安、文化のスーパーゴールデンタイムなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 364.187,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b00.wav",
          "start": 364.187,
          "duration": 2.283,
          "text": "でも、華やかだけじゃないのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b01.wav",
          "start": 366.769,
          "duration": 3.989,
          "text": "そう、この時代も世の中は荒れ、人々の心は疲れていきます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b02.wav",
          "start": 371.059,
          "duration": 1.899,
          "text": "そこで広まったのが浄土思想です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b03.wav",
          "start": 373.257,
          "duration": 2.464,
          "text": "阿弥陀如来を信じて、死んだ後、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b04.wav",
          "start": 376.021,
          "duration": 3.157,
          "text": "来世の極楽浄土に生まれ変わりたい、という願いです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b05.wav",
          "start": 379.479,
          "duration": 1.643,
          "text": "来世でリベンジなのだ…?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b06.wav",
          "start": 381.421,
          "duration": 2.304,
          "text": "源信が『往生要集』を書き、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b07.wav",
          "start": 384.025,
          "duration": 4.235,
          "text": "空也のような遊行聖が念佛を広めて、人々の心を支えました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s12_b08.wav",
          "start": 388.56,
          "duration": 2.272,
          "text": "心の支え、大切なのだ。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "section": "story",
      "start": 391.432,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b00.wav",
          "start": 391.432,
          "duration": 2.411,
          "text": "世の中が荒れると、どうなるのだ?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b01.wav",
          "start": 394.143,
          "duration": 5.877,
          "text": "荘園や国の争いを守るため、武力のプロ、武士の登場です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b02.wav",
          "start": 400.32,
          "duration": 3.371,
          "text": "源氏や平氏の名は、ここで育ちます。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b03.wav",
          "start": 403.991,
          "duration": 4.011,
          "text": "ついに武士が来るのだ!?次の回、これは見逃せないのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b04.wav",
          "start": 408.301,
          "duration": 3.776,
          "text": "その前に、今日のポイントをきっちりまとめて、次回へ行きましょう!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s13_b05.wav",
          "start": 412.377,
          "duration": 1.771,
          "text": "まとめ、お願いなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s14",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 414.948,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b00.wav",
          "start": 414.948,
          "duration": 2.976,
          "text": "ここから受験ポイントのまとめ!まずは政治の流れ。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b01.wav",
          "start": 418.224,
          "duration": 7.445,
          "text": "794年平安京遷都、797年坂上田村麻呂が征夷大将軍、"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b02.wav",
          "start": 425.969,
          "duration": 3.179,
          "text": "810年薬子の変で蔵人所。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b03.wav",
          "start": 429.448,
          "duration": 5.675,
          "text": "そして藤原氏の摂関政治、荘園のはじまりは743年。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b04.wav",
          "start": 435.423,
          "duration": 5.515,
          "text": "摂政=幼い天皇の代わり、関白=大人の天皇の補佐。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s14_b05.wav",
          "start": 441.237,
          "duration": 1.995,
          "text": "この区別も大事です。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s15",
      "section": "points",
      "start": 443.832,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b00.wav",
          "start": 443.832,
          "duration": 2.283,
          "text": "後半は、文化と心のまとめです。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b01.wav",
          "start": 446.415,
          "duration": 3.392,
          "text": "国風文化=かなで土佐日記(紀貫之)・"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b02.wav",
          "start": 450.107,
          "duration": 5.035,
          "text": "枕草子(清少納言)・源氏物語(紫式部)、絵巻物。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b03.wav",
          "start": 455.441,
          "duration": 4.149,
          "text": "浄土思想=阿弥陀如来への信仰と来世の願い。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s15_b04.wav",
          "start": 459.891,
          "duration": 9.088,
          "text": "「894遣唐使停止→国風文化」「乱世→浄土思想」。流れで覚えれば忘れません!"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s16",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 469.779,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b00.wav",
          "start": 469.779,
          "duration": 2.091,
          "text": "それではクイズタイム!第一問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b01.wav",
          "start": 472.169,
          "duration": 10.133,
          "text": "幼い天皇の代わりに政治を行う役を何という?ア、関白。イ、摂政。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b02.wav",
          "start": 482.603,
          "duration": 2.08,
          "text": "ウ、征夷大将軍。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b03.wav",
          "start": 484.983,
          "duration": 2.368,
          "text": "こども天皇の代わり…イなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b04.wav",
          "start": 487.651,
          "duration": 1.611,
          "text": "正解!摂政です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s16_b05.wav",
          "start": 489.561,
          "duration": 3.509,
          "text": "大人の天皇を支えるのは関白、とセットでまとめしましょう。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s17",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 493.671,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b00.wav",
          "start": 493.671,
          "duration": 0.661,
          "text": "第二問!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b01.wav",
          "start": 494.632,
          "duration": 8.587,
          "text": "清少納言が書いた、「をかし」の随筆は何でしょう?ア、源氏物語。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b02.wav",
          "start": 503.519,
          "duration": 1.792,
          "text": "イ、土佐日記。ウ、枕草子。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b03.wav",
          "start": 505.611,
          "duration": 2.261,
          "text": "をかし、をかし…ウなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b04.wav",
          "start": 508.172,
          "duration": 1.856,
          "text": "正解!枕草子です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s17_b05.wav",
          "start": 510.328,
          "duration": 4.512,
          "text": "源氏物語は紫式部、土佐日記は紀貫之、ペアでしっかりね。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s18",
      "section": "quiz",
      "start": 515.44,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b00.wav",
          "start": 515.44,
          "duration": 0.843,
          "text": "ラスト問題!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b01.wav",
          "start": 516.583,
          "duration": 8.533,
          "text": "810年、藤原薬子が政治を元に戻そうとして失敗した事件は?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b02.wav",
          "start": 525.416,
          "duration": 3.659,
          "text": "ア、薬子の変。イ、応天門の変。ウ、保元の乱。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b03.wav",
          "start": 529.375,
          "duration": 2.251,
          "text": "薬子さんはやっぱり…アなのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b04.wav",
          "start": 531.925,
          "duration": 1.813,
          "text": "正解!薬子の変です。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s18_b05.wav",
          "start": 534.039,
          "duration": 3.456,
          "text": "この直後に蔵人所が新設された、セットでしっかりね。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s19",
      "section": "ending",
      "start": 538.295,
      "beats": [
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b00.wav",
          "start": 538.295,
          "duration": 4.224,
          "text": "今日は平安京から国風文化まで、華やかで奥深い時代を見ました。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b01.wav",
          "start": 542.819,
          "duration": 4.576,
          "text": "摂関政治、枕草子、源氏物語、浄土思想…"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b02.wav",
          "start": 547.695,
          "duration": 2.613,
          "text": "貴族の世界、ぜんぶ覚えたのだ!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b03.wav",
          "start": 550.608,
          "duration": 3.115,
          "text": "さすがです。次回第4話は、ついに武士の登場。"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "sensei",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b04.wav",
          "start": 554.023,
          "duration": 3.083,
          "text": "源平合戦と鎌倉幕府の話、お楽しみに!"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "manabu",
          "wav": "narration/s19_b05.wav",
          "start": 557.405,
          "duration": 3.925,
          "text": "つぎは刀なのだ!?チャンネル登録も、よろしくなのだ!"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
